{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f7b192652cf35c1f","name":"Spaarti Stormtrooper","source":{"id":"source:reference-f7b192652cf35c1f","title":"Spaarti Stormtrooper","revision":19578,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:13:28Z","sha256":"c14e039ed951e06df082e19be866a11abf6ba1825543c0895519bf796c15a315","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19578","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Spaarti%20Stormtrooper&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f7b192652cf35c1f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["With the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kaminoan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kaminoan","referenceId":"reference:5acecf7158f82e5c"}," cloning facilities shut down and the limited number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Veteran Clone Troopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Veteran_Clone_Troopers"}," aging quickly, the Empire began dabbling in alternative cloning techniques very early in its reign. One technique that was utilized briefly during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"}," was pioneered by cloners on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cartao"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cartao?action=edit&redlink=1"}," whose technology was based on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Khommite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Khommite?action=edit&redlink=1"}," cloning techniques. The clones produced by the Spaarti cloning method- which used cloning cylinders designed by Spaarti Creations- were fully grown and ready to fight within a year's time. Although this effort provided the Empire with a fast solution to the problem of declining troop numbers, it brought with it a large number of other problems. Clones grown in Spaarti cloning cylinders are notoriously unstable, and any clones that are incubated and grown in less than a year inevitably go insane. Additionally, Spaarti clones must have their minds formed by a process known as \"Flash Memory,\" which involves writing the memories of another trooper (usually an exceptionally loyal, disciplined, and skilled warrior) to the fresh clone's brain. Imperfections in this process often result in brain damage, and even when successful, the final results are far inferior to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kaminoan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kaminoan","referenceId":"reference:5acecf7158f82e5c"}," method of combat training.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though the method of producing clones in Spaarti cloning cylinders allowed the Empire to produce more troops within a year, most of these troops were far inferior to the troopers who were veterans of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},". Moreover, when Spaarti clones were used to supplement troopers that served in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", conflicts between the two types of clones sprung up almost immediately. The clones based on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jango Fett"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jango_Fett","referenceId":"reference:bf47d6b339ff73dd"}," recoiled at the thought of fighting alongside the Spaarti clones, which they saw as freakish experiments rather than trained soldiers. Additionally, Spaarti clones often displayed unstable tendencies on the battlefield, refusing to follow orders or even turning on their own allies in fits of madness. As a result of these inefficiencies, the Empire abandoned its Spaarti cloning efforts and pursued the process of recruiting soldiers for the Empire in more traditional ways. A few Spaarti clones serve in the Empire early in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Times"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Times"},", but by the time of the Rebellion they are little more than a memory of a failed experiment.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Spaarti Stormtrooper Statistics (CL 1)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 4\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +2; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low-Light_Vision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 16 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 16), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 12, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 9\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse